a kani antele a kani veydipo a kani patolomaw a kani matay a kani tomase a kani yake a anak ni alevey a kani tatay a kani simong a macikagom do macioya do loma a tao
maniring si yeso jira am kokay kamo kamo nimakamong an maniring sira am jyabo yasa namen nimamong a yakasahep a
no nyo na katenngan o akman sya nanao am no si pangononongan nyo am tey rako o sarasaray nyo an pazimanen na o keyyan no manazang nya
sira ori am akmey kanakan a meyyalalam do rarahan a manci no namen ipeyyanwanood inyo am kanyo ji maganam namen amlavi am kanyo ji lavi
