am sira rana manyahey a tao a kano ji nganoyong jyaken a tao a kano somagpyan a kano manwakwak a kano mangzakza so icyatatao da kano manlita no oyowyat ni satan a kano manaralay so malas a iraralay a kano mangalalas a tao am amyan so akmey awa so karakorako a lila no apoy a omapanala sira ori rana am ipirwa kawakwak ori vayo a yelosaleng
