o na nitoro jyamen ni yeso kizisto a vazay namen am namen sidongen inyo beken a namen ipeyparaherahet inyo am ori an tana teywara o pazwayan namen so vazay namen am jyabo kanig namen a
meyratateng am meynozi sira a manci no mo panirsirngen mo katenngan o nakenakem no tao do teyrahem so pancyan mo nya jyamen so nipamnekan mo do yararwa eya
maniring si yeso jya am no si myan so malas a ko nipanci am pancyaney do aro a tao eyto am no si manoyong o ciring ko am ikongo mo to niplangi jyaken
citahen na pa sira ni yeso maniring jira am o masalit do tao am mowwamek ji ama ta do to ta abo ji na peyvazay ni ama ta do to
